msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "nedelja"

msgid "The waked up box will be turned into standby after automatic EPG import wake up."
msgstr "Prebujeno polje bo po prebujanju samodejnega uvoza EPG prešlo v stanje pripravljenosti."

msgid "This is for advanced users that are using the channel id filtering feature. If enabled, the filter rules defined into /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf will also be applied on your /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml file."
msgstr "To je za napredne uporabnike, ki uporabljajo funkcijo filtriranja ID-ja kanala. Če je omogočeno, bodo pravila filtra, definirana v /etc/epgimport/channel_id_filter.conf, uporabljena tudi v vaši datoteki /etc/epgimport/custom.channels.xml."

msgid "This will clear the current EPG data in memory before updating the EPG data. This allows you to always have a clean new EPG with the latest EPG data, for example in case of program changes between refresh, otherwise EPG data are cumulative."
msgstr "To bo izbrisalo trenutne podatke EPG v pomnilniku pred posodobitvijo podatkov EPG. To vam omogoča, da imate vedno čist nov EPG z najnovejšimi podatki EPG, na primer v primeru sprememb programa med osveževanjem, sicer so podatki EPG kumulativni."

msgid "This will turn back waked up box into deep-standby after automatic EPG import."
msgstr "To bo po samodejnem uvozu EPG ponovno preklopilo prebujeno škatlo v globoko pripravljenost."

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "četrtek"

msgid "To save memory you can decide to load EPG data only  for theIPTV channels."
msgstr "Da prihranite pomnilnik, se lahko odločite za nalaganje podatkov EPG samo za kanale IPTV."

msgid "To save memory you can decide to only load EPG data for the services that you have in your bouquet files."
msgstr "Da prihranite pomnilnik, se lahko odločite, da naložite samo podatke EPG za storitve, ki jih imate v svojih datotekah šopkov."

